 70% and subjected to arcsinetransformation before further analysis. Values are expressed as average %motility. Error bars are 90% confidence limits.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="IDOG2008-540758.001"/></fig><table-wrap id="tab1" position="float"><label>Table 1</label><caption><p>Ectocervical cell viability after prolonged exposure to subtilosin.</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><th align="center" colspan="6" rowspan="1">Postexposure cell viability (%)</th></tr><tr><th align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Exposure time (hrs)</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Assay #</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Subtilosin</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Nonoxynol-9 (4%)</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Miconazole nitrate (4%)</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">ddH<sub>2</sub>O</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">4</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">99.1</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">14.1</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">ND</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">100</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">2</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">100</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">16.5</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">ND</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">100</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">24</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">94.8</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">58.4</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">100</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">2</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">89.8</td><td align="center" rowspan="1"